OL,3,GNEWSAMajor A-road to close as cranes
OL,4,Alift in new bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of a major road near Norwich
OL,7,Fwill be fully closed in both directions
OL,8,Ffor a weekend while bridge beams are
OL,9,Flifted in for a new link road.
OL,11,FThe A11 will be shut between the
OL,12,FThickthorn roundabout, south of
OL,13,FNorwich, and Wymondham, between 20:00
OL,14,FBST on Friday 18 September and 06:00 on
OL,15,FMonday 21 September, with diversions in
OL,16,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
