OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMajor A-road to close as cranes
OL,4,Alift in new bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new bridge is part of a #200m
OL,7,Fredesign of Thickthorn and will
OL,8,Feventually carry the Cantley Lane link
OL,9,Froad, which will connect Cantley Lane
OL,10,FSouth, Cringleford, with the B1172
OL,11,FHethersett Bypass.
OL,13,F"The bridge sections will be lifted
OL,14,Finto position using large cranes; for
OL,15,Fsafety reasons, this can only be done
OL,16,Fif the A11 is closed," said National
OL,17,FHighways.
